-test module into the conventional `commands/test/stage_test.rs` location. Its implementation body and all 90 fixture files are unchanged. The combined source tree is `733c981de96ad6ac280a036355bd81be4bbdd1a3`; Git index reconstruction confirms its identity.\n\nSource-only merge disposition: ordinary Sherlock reporting QA passed 230 tests and plugin guidance passed 10. Cargo/Rust compilation and runtime tests, SDK/proof checks and ledger execution remain UNRUN. No native resource counter or EARS/product acceptance is reset. The optional SDK-linked Cargo test was not admitted by the security reviewer.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T02:45:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:48:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T04:48:14Z","merged_at":"2026-10-18T04:48:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"baf61ebd0cb49f2c4441cb7fa8de53b343e056dc","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CharlesHoskinson:feat/mori-test-stages-r3-20261016","ref":"feat/mori-test-stages-r3-20261016","repo":{"id":1360485122,"node_id":"R_kgDOURdbAg","name":"Moriarty","full_name":"CharlesHoskinson/Moriarty","owner":{"login":"CharlesHoskinson","id":3279952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3279952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson","html_url":"https://github.com/CharlesHoskinson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharlesHoskinson/repos","events_url":"https://a